{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51550","headline":"观梦龟草书 · 可朋","name":"观梦龟草书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲尽金锺数斗余，从容攘臂立踟蹰。\n先教侍者浓磨墨，不揖傍人欻便书。\n画状倒松横洞壑，点麄飞石落空虚。\n兴来抹亦成字，只恐张颠颠不如。\n（《六艺之一录》二九四引陈思《书苑菁华》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"可朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}